Z||000000||Ed||04-04-2000||12:40 AM||||Where do you recommend the sunroof sun shade be stored?  The owner's manual doesn't say.  In the same place as the sunroof glass in the front trunk? <P>I got mine back after an absence of several years.  Story on request. ||||reg||1
Z||000001||Standard||04-04-2000||01:07 AM||||I'd guess it's stored in the same place the sunroof would go..<P>Let's hear the story!||||reg||1
Z||000002||sdm1964||04-04-2000||05:52 AM||||Yea come on tell the story!!!!!!||||reg||14
Z||000003||Old Lar||04-04-2000||05:56 AM||||I store mine in the bag, under the hood where you would store the sun roof when you remove the sun roof.  Thats where I found it when I bought the car new.  I guess you could store it in the trunk like where the t-tops get stored when you remove them.||||reg||3
Z||000004||Ed||04-04-2000||09:17 PM||||I bought my '87 ten (!) years ago after my bought new '84 was re-ended and totaled.  The sunshade was in the trunk.  I knew even then that the shades were a little rare.  They sold at that time for about $75.  <P>I used it a few times and decided I really didn't need it.  The A/C worked well enough. A friend in our local club said he was interested in buying it.  So I sold it to him for a few bucks.<P>I almost immediately had seller's remorse, because I realized the rarity of the shades. I asked him several times about buying it back, but he wanted to keep it.  He had an earlier model Fiero which didn't even come with the shade as an option.  <P>Well, he's sort of leaving the flock (although he has a second Fiero) because he's selling the car he kept the shade with.  When I learned he was selling it, I asked him again to sell the shade back to me, which he kindly did.  Nice guy. <P>So now I have the original sun shade that came with the car.  Long story! <P>P.S.  I can't remember how many years passed between sales.  Six, seven, eight? I'm persistent if nothing else.  <p>[This message has been edited by Ed (edited 04-04-2000).]||||reg||1
Z||000005||TheFiero64||04-05-2000||01:06 PM||||I keep mine in the trunk. It fits perfect on the top shelf part. It hides all my other junk in the deep part. It fits & looks good there. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/apr05^04.jpg"> ||||reg||10
